---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this notice
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Covered material. CC BY 4.0 applies to the artifacts produced by the
   authors of this work and released in this repository: the derived
   per-image prediction records, the analysis and figure-generation scripts,
   the run logs, and the documentation authored here (DATA, README, and
   MANIFEST files).

2. Source datasets are not covered. The source image datasets used in this
   work are not redistributed here, and nothing in this repository grants a
   license to them. Each remains governed by the terms set by its own
   provider. In particular, the MTDC dataset is distributed by its provider
   for academic use only. Users must obtain each dataset from its provider
   and comply with that provider's terms; the providers are identified in the
   dataset section of the paper.

3. Redistributed third-party files. Where a file here is a verbatim copy of
   material authored by a third party, that file remains under its original
   terms and is included only as required for reproducibility. Such files are
   identified in the per-file manifest (MANIFEST.csv) and in the notes
   accompanying them.

4. The manuscript text itself is not covered by this notice; it is subject to
   the terms of its publisher.

For the material described in clause 1, if this notice and the CC BY 4.0
legal code differ, the legal code governs.
